{"id":"00305","root":"uni00305_1","name":{"ja":"リーナ","en":"Lina"},"title":{"ja":"【a．k．a．嵐騎】","en":"【A.K.A. Storm Rider】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【a．k．a．嵐騎】 リーナ","en":"【A.K.A. Storm Rider】 Lina"},"aliases":["Leena"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Nomad"],"release":"2020-03-16","limited":true,"characterId":21,"profile":{"ja":"ノマドの騎士軍に所属する騎士。イングリッドなど一流の魔界騎士にはまだまだ及ばないが、日々の鍛錬により彼女自身の力が目覚めつつあり、日増しに強くなっていっている。その存在はイングリッドたちの目にも止まり、リーナはその風を操る力から、『嵐騎』の二つ名を授かった。そんなリーナはある日、上層部から「とある事情で着用するように」という命令とともにポップで可愛い衣装を支給される。当初は騎士たる者にこのような服をと憤っていた彼女だったが、実際に着てみると結構気に入ったようで、鏡の前でこっそりノリノリなポーズを取ったりしているところを、同じ騎士団の者に目撃されている。","en":"(Lina, she/her) Lina is a knight serving in the nomadic Knight Corps. Though she still falls short of elite Demon Realm knights like Ingrid, her daily training is awakening her own power, and she grows stronger with each passing day. Her abilities have even caught the eyes of Ingrid and the others, and because Lina can manipulate the wind, she has been given the epithet \"Storm Knight.\" One day, the higher-ups ordered her to wear a pop-and-cute outfit for \"certain reasons\" and supplied it to her. At first she was outraged that a knight should have to wear such clothes, but after trying it on she seemed to like it, secretly striking a flashy pose in front of the mirror—an act later witnessed by a fellow member of the order."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"烏丸そら","forms":[{"id":"uni00305_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[964,1928],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[159,318],"def":[111,222],"spd":[58,58],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","500007"]},{"id":"uni00305_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1428,2856],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[253,506],"def":[157,314],"spd":[58,58],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","500007","500008"]},{"id":"uni00305_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1892,3797],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[352,702],"def":[208,416],"spd":[58,58],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","500007","500008"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"500007":{"slot":"skill1","id":500007,"name":{"ja":"ストームレコード"},"hits":4,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 340% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"500008":{"slot":"skill2","id":500008,"name":{"ja":"チェックイット"},"hits":4,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 107% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"All enemies: 40% chance to inflict Paralysis for 2 turns","icon":"paralysis","tag":"ailment"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"嵐のリリック"},"detail":{"ja":"部隊全体のSPDを小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"All allies: SPD +10%","icon":"spd_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00005",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00005",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00005",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00005",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00005",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00005",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00005",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ヘイヨー、ＷＨＡＴ’ＵＰ！　き、刻んでいくぜ嵐騎の技、この生き様、とくと拝みな！　ヨー、チェケラ！","en":"Hey yo, WHAT'UP! I'll slice away with the Storm Rider's technique, this way of life, worship it! Yo, check it!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"うぅ～む……騎士たるもの、こんな格好をするのはどうなんだ……？　いや、いかんいかん！　これも立派な騎士になるための修行だ！　たぶん！","en":"Umm… as a knight, is it okay to dress like this?… No, no! This is also training to become a proper knight! Probably!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"何を笑って――え、かわいい？　ま、まぁ当然だな！　騎士たるもの強いだけでなくイングリッド様みたいに美しくもないとな！　ナイトだけに！","en":"What are you laughing at—eh, cute? Well, of course! A knight must be not only strong but also beautiful like Lady Ingrid! That's what a night—"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"なにっ、ＤＪはらっぷしなくていいのか！？　ぐぬぬ、あんな恥ずかしい思いをさせられたのにっ……","en":"What? The DJ shouldn't rap? Grrr, after making me feel so embarrassed…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"私にはよくわからんが、なんでも――そに、子？　とやらのこすぷれ、だそうだ……これでもノマドの連中には、わりと評判がいいんだぞ？","en":"I don't really get it, but apparently there's some cosplay thing called… \"Soni, ko?\"… Even so, the Nomads think it's pretty popular, you know?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"『a.k.a』とはなんのことか、だと？　ふふふ、教えてやろう……おーそーのうんあず。～としても知られる、という意味だ！","en":"You ask what \"a.k.a\" means? Hehehe, let me tell you… It basically means \"also known as\"!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ぐぬぬ、騎士たるものがこんな格好をさせられるとは……は、早く合流して、この場所を離れなくては……なんか、すごい見られてるし……","en":"Grrr, to think a knight has to wear something like this... I need to regroup quickly and get out of here... I feel like everyone's staring at me..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"ま、まぁかわいいのは当然だからな！　なに、撮影？　仕方ない、手早く頼むぞ？　こんなポーズはどうだ、カッコいいだろう！","en":"Well, of course it's cute! What, a photo shoot? Fine, make it quick, okay? How about this pose—looks cool, right?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00305_1/uni00305_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100],"scenes":[["chr_0205_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0205a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":100,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00305","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00305_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0205"}}